
## plain: two CPUs, an edge-triggered device, two snapshots, two restores; no host time passes while the guest does not run
cloud-hypervisor: 124260 states; R1 lostIpi@5 R2 stuckActive@6 R2 stuckPriority@6 R2 strayPending@5 R3 spins@8
fork-default: 36948 states;
design-cloud-hypervisor: 38700 states;
design-firecracker: 38700 states;

## level: the device's interrupt is level-triggered and the device holds its line
